## Symptom 3 root cause (CONFIRMED, no question)

`DeviceManager.tsx:134-138` calls:
  buildRelayChannelViewModels(displayChannels, relayState.channels, {})

The third arg is `{}` — the empty `lastStateChangeByDevice` map. That makes
`lastStateChangeAt = null` for every channel, so `formatElapsedSince(null, nowMs)`
permanently returns `'Unknown'`. The label is not "frozen"; it never had a value.

Fix: fetch control history per ZONE inside DeviceManager (same call signature as
`useSensorPolling`: `apiClient.getControlHistory(zone.location, zone.cluster, 10)`),
run `buildLastStateChangeMap(history)` (already exported from `relayViewModel.ts`),
pass result as the third arg.

